# Changelog

All notable changes to DysinIDE are documented in this file.

The format is based on Keep a Changelog.

## [1.1.1] - 2026-10-30

### Added
- Introduced a new font system.
- Added text highlighting functionality.

### Changed
- Refined the user interface and overall user experience.
- Updated existing application functionality.

### Fixed
- Fixed issues affecting application stability.
- Fixed terminal output handling.
- Resolved issues that could cause the terminal to crash.

### Improved
- Refined code editor responsiveness.
- Improved terminal behaviour.
- Made general application performance improvements.

### Known Issues
- Terminal behaviour remains inconsistent and requires further improvements.

### Planned
- Further terminal improvements are planned for v1.1.2.
- Additional compiler support is in development.

---

## [1.0.1] - Previous Release

### Added
- Introduced the typing system.

### Changed
- Updated file system functionality.

### Fixed
- Fixed issues with the graphical user interface theme.